TI  - Beyond greenwashing: How green reporting authenticity triggers moral emotions and value congruence to drive green purchase intention
PY  - 2026
T2  - International Review of Economics and Finance
VL  - 108
C7  - 105210
DO  - 10.1016/j.iref.2026.105210
