TI  - Governing Generative AI for Healthy Ageing: A Normative Conceptual Framework for Societal Alignment, Epistemic Authority, and Value Convergence in Geriatric Care
PY  - 2026
T2  - Healthcare (Switzerland)
VL  - 14
IS  - 12
C7  - 1660
