AB  - The rapid development of generative artificial intelligence has injected strong impetus into the digital transformation of education, especially in the field of ideological and political education, where it demonstrates great potential. This article focuses on the integration path and technical implementation of AIGC (Artificial Intelligence Generated Content) in ideological and political education, and innovatively proposes the core architecture of "ideological and political large model". By integrating big data of ideological and political education, constructing a value-oriented reinforcement learning algorithm, and relying on powerful computing power, this model achieves intelligent generation and precise distribution of educational content, multi-dimensional profiling of educational objects, as well as the innovation of immersive human-computer interaction paradigms. The article elaborates in detail on the generation logic, core features and key functions of the ideological and political big model. In addition, a special algorithm for optimizing the generation of ideological and political content based on the Transformer architecture was specially designed, and multi-modal interaction effectiveness evaluation indicators were introduced for quantitative analysis. The simulation experiments show that the model incorporating the value alignment mechanism outperforms the general model in terms of content accuracy and value orientation compliance. It can be seen that this study has constructed an AIGC-enabled ideological and political education technology framework that is "guided by values, based on data, bridged by algorithms, and utilized through interaction". This provides a feasible theoretical support and practical path for promoting the intelligence, precision, and effectiveness of ideological and political education.  © 2025 Copyright held by the owner/author(s).
