TI  - “Where lies the grail? AI, common sense, and human practical intelligence”
PY  - 2026
T2  - Phenomenology and the Cognitive Sciences
VL  - 25
IS  - 2
SP  - 289
EP  - 310
DO  - 10.1007/s11097-023-09942-x
