TI  - Multilevel Analysis of Value Alignment With Medical Care and Prevention Integration Among Family Doctors and Health Status of Chronic Disease Patients: The Mediating Role of Team Cohesion
ST  - 家庭医生医防融合价值认同与慢性病患者健康状态的多水平分析：团队凝聚力的中介作用
