AB  - This paper delves into the crucial domain of AI alignment, aiming to provide a comprehensive understanding of its fundamental concepts, motivations, and the alignment cycle framework. With the increasing capabilities of AI systems, the risks associated with misalignment have become more prominent. We first analyze the risks and causes of misalignment, highlighting the importance of alignment research. Then, we introduce the alignment cycle, which consists of forward alignment and backward alignment, and discuss how it serves as a framework for ensuring AI systems adhere to human intentions and values. This research contributes to the growing body of knowledge in AI safety, offering insights for future research and development in the field. © 2026 World Scientific Publishing Company.
