AB  - This study presents the development of AI tutors that support learners in constructionist gaming environments. AI tutor-learning support is designed to offer direct answers to learners’ questions, while AI tutor-feedback aims to evaluate code scripts based on computational thinking concepts. The AI tutors were designed through in-context learning with background prompts, ensuring tailored support and targeted feedback. The work-in-progress paper highlights the features of AI tutors and how AI alignment and tuning techniques can provide individual learning support. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2025.
