TI  - From Human Mind to Artificial Intelligence: Advancing AI Value Alignment Through Psychological Theories
ST  - 由“心”及“智”：心理学研究促进 AI 价值观对齐的路径探讨
PY  - 2025
T2  - Journal of Psychological Science
VL  - 48
IS  - 4
SP  - 782
