AB  - This paper presents a methodological and empirical framework for the AI Moral Code, based on the Normative, Regulatory, Behavioral, and Conceptual (NRBC) architecture. Analyzing 291 AI ethics documents (2006-2025), it identifies high-frequency values and forecasts emerging trends. The framework translates ethical priorities into system design and governance, offering evidence-based insights and supporting value alignment across sectors such as healthcare, education, justice, and autonomous vehicle technologies. © 2025 IEEE.
