AB  - Artificial Intelligence (AI) is transforming industries & redefining human experience, but its accelerated development creates urgent concerns around safety, control & values alignment. This paper presents the idea of "taming"AI, applying structures & procedures to make AI systems transparent, responsible & aligned with human values. It analyze alignment techniques like Inverse Reinforcement Learning & Human-in-the-Loop systems, as well as critical control processes like kill switches & regulatory supervision. It explores main challenges like explainability, bias, robustness, & energy efficiency. Using a multidisciplinary perspective, it emphasize the legal & ethical necessity of AI regulation & calls for coordinated effort from technologists, policymakers & society. The aim is not merely to reduce risks but to unlock AI's potential for transformation in a safe, secure & fair way. Hence this work helps to create a future where AI respects people, builds public trust, & supports progress for everyone in society.  © 2025 IEEE.
