TI  - A values-aligned intervention fosters growth mindset-supportive teaching and reduces inequality in educational outcomes
PY  - 2023
T2  - Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States of America
VL  - 120
IS  - 25
C7  - e2210704120
DO  - 10.1073/pnas.2210704120
